        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical delivery time for a Patna to Amritsar relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, our dedicated multi‑axle trucks cover the 850 km distance in 12‑14 hours. We factor in driver rest periods, route inspections and any mandatory checkpoints, ensuring a reliable and on‑time delivery without compromising safety.</p>
