        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you provide insurance for vehicle transportation on the Patna‑Amritsar corridor?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All car and bike shipments are covered by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. Our specialized carriers feature hydraulic loading ramps, wheel chocks and high‑tensile ratchet lashings, guaranteeing secure transport and full compensation in the unlikely event of damage.</p>
